OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners angry at outdoor
OL,4,Acentre petition decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council's decision not to act on a
OL,7,Fpetition to help save an outdoor centre
OL,8,Fhas been met with an outcry from
OL,9,Fsupporters.
OL,11,FNorth Tyneside Council members met on
OL,12,FThursday to respond to the petition
OL,13,Fcalling for a six-month pause to the
OL,14,Fplanned closure of local
OL,15,Fauthority-owned High Borrans in
OL,16,FWindermere, Cumbria.
OL,18,FCries of "shame on you" were heard from
OL,19,Fthe public gallery as councillors voted
OL,20,Fto note the 2,000-signature petition,
OL,21,Frather than act upon it.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
