OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners angry at outdoor
OL,4,Acentre petition decision
OL,5,
OL,6,FDan Dembry-Edwards from campaign group
OL,7,FFriends of High Borrans told the Local
OL,8,FDemocracy Reporting Service: "I really
OL,9,Fthink it is a disgraceful decision,
OL,10,Fthat is the only word I can use." The
OL,11,Fcouncil has said the centre loses
OL,12,F#200,000 a year.
